---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import { localePath } from '../i18n';
const serverFacts = 'https://github.com/mykcs/zju-server/blob/main/docs/server-facts.md';
const experimentRepo = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment';
---
<AppLayout title="实验设备与服务器" description="当前 OpenEvo 实验使用 5×RTX5090 分配；服务器资产记录可见 8×RTX5090。RTX6 / 4×RTX3090 为历史实验平台。" locale="zh">
  <div class="shell editorial-page lab-current-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="section-kicker">实验环境 · 2026-08-14</span>
      <h1>实验设备与服务器</h1>
      <p class="lede">当前 OpenEvo × WebShop 科学实验由 <code>openevo-experiment</code> 维护，本次实验分配为 <strong>5×RTX5090</strong>。RTX6 的 4×RTX3090 只作为历史实验与迁移证据保留。</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="current-server-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">当前</span><h2 id="current-server-title">OpenEvo 实验服务器</h2></div></div>
      <dl class="lab-facts">
        <div><dt>实验分配</dt><dd>5× NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</dd></div>
        <div><dt>服务器可见库存</dt><dd>8× NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090</dd></div>
        <div><dt>实验仓库</dt><dd><code>mykcs/openevo-experiment</code></dd></div>
        <div><dt>当前阶段</dt><dd>Phase H0 · Natural Success Search</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p class="muted">“服务器可见 8 卡”是机器资产事实，不等于每次实验都使用 8 卡。本页按当前实验分配显示 5 卡。</p>
      <div class="lab-links"><a class="button button-secondary" href={serverFacts} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">服务器事实 ↗</a><a class="button button-secondary" href={experimentRepo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">实验仓库 ↗</a><a class="button button-primary" href={localePath('zh','/research/seed-openevo/results/')}>实验结果 →</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="history-server-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">历史</span><h2 id="history-server-title">RTX6 · 4×RTX3090</h2></div></div>
      <p>RTX6 曾承担 WebShop / ALFWorld bring-up、早期 OpenEvo 参数实验和大量工程调试。相关日志、失败轨迹和迁移证据继续保存在 <code>seed3090</code> 与历史运行记录中，但它不再代表当前实验硬件。</p>
      <div class="history-grid"><article><strong>seed3090</strong><span>RTX6 工程与早期实验档案</span></article><article><strong>openevo-webshop</strong><span>WebShop × SD-LoRA 迁移仓库</span></article><article><strong>openevo-experiment</strong><span>当前正式实验 source of truth</span></article></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="paths-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">入口</span><h2 id="paths-title">实验页面</h2></div></div>
      <div class="history-grid"><a href={localePath('zh','/guide/openevo-webshop-alfworld/')}><strong>复现指南</strong><span>当前服务器、WebShop 合同与 Phase H0</span></a><a href={localePath('zh','/research/seed-openevo/experiment/')}><strong>实验入口</strong><span>OpenEvo × WebShop 数据流</span></a><a href={localePath('zh','/research/seed-openevo/results/')}><strong>实验结果</strong><span>Phase D–F、Phase G 与历史证据</span></a></div>
    </section>
  </div>
</AppLayout>

<style>
.lab-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.65rem;margin:0}.lab-facts div{padding:.9rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px}.lab-facts dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.68rem}.lab-facts dd{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.86rem;font-weight:750}.lab-links{display:flex;gap:.55rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}.history-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem}.history-grid article,.history-grid>a{padding:.9rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.history-grid strong,.history-grid span{display:block}.history-grid span{margin-top:.35rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.74rem;line-height:1.45}.section>p{max-width:78ch;line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:700px){.lab-facts,.history-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
